<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>CASE #012 - The Man in the Window</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: #080808;
            color: #ddd;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .case {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #101010;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #b30000;
            font-size: 32px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .warning {
            border-left: 3px solid #b30000;
            padding-left: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .time {
            color: #b30000;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .end {
            margin-top: 35px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            color: #777;
            font-style: italic;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="case">

    <h1>CASE #012</h1>

    <h2>THE MAN IN THE WINDOW</h2>

    <div class="warning">
        CASE STATUS: UNSOLVED<br>
        LOCATION: UNKNOWN<br>
        LAST RECORDED: 03:17 AM
    </div>

    <p>
        17 October 2019 ko police ko ek strange complaint mili.
        Ek 19 saal ki ladki ne bataya ki woh pichhle 11 din se
        har raat apne bedroom ki window se ek aadmi ko dekh rahi thi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Aadmi hamesha saamne wali building ki third floor window mein
        khada hota tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Woh hilta nahi tha.
        Bas window ke paas khada hokar seedha uske ghar ki taraf dekhta tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Ladki ne pehle socha ki koi neighbour hoga.
        Lekin ek problem thi...
    </p>

    <p class="warning">
        Saamne wali building wahan thi hi nahi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Us jagah sirf ek purani khaali plot thi.
        Police records ke according woh building
        <b>1998 mein demolish</b> kar di gayi thi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Police ne ladki ki window se us jagah ko check kiya.
        Kuch bhi unusual nahi mila.
    </p>

    <p>
        Lekin us raat <span class="time">03:17 AM</span> par
        ladki ne phir us aadmi ko dekha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Is baar aadmi window ke andar khada nahi tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Woh window ke bilkul paas tha...
        aur uska face clearly visible tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Ladki ne police ko bataya ki aadmi muskura raha tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Phir usne apna haath uthaya...
        aur window ke glass par kuch likha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Ladki ne zoom karke dekha.
    </p>

    <p class="warning">
        "LOOK BEHIND YOU."
    </p>

    <p>
        Ladki turant peeche mud gayi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Room khaali tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Jab usne dobara window ki taraf dekha,
        aadmi gayab tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Lekin uske bedroom ke glass par
        ek fingerprint tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Fingerprint <b>andar ki side</b> par tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Police ne poora room search kiya.
        Darwaza locked tha.
        Window bhi andar se locked thi.
        Kisi ke enter karne ka koi sign nahi tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Investigation ke dauran police ko ek purani photograph mili.
        Photograph 1997 ki thi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Us photograph mein wahi demolished building dikh rahi thi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Third floor ki window mein ek aadmi khada tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Police ne photograph ko zoom kiya.
    </p>

    <p class="warning">
        Woh aadmi exactly wahi tha
        jise ladki har raat dekh rahi thi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Photograph ke peeche sirf ek date likhi thi:
    </p>

    <p class="time">
        17 October 1999
    </p>

    <p>
        Lekin photograph 1997 ki thi.
    </p>

    <p>
        Case yahin close kar diya gaya.
    </p>

    <p>
        Teen mahine baad ladki ne apna ghar chhod diya.
        Usne kabhi explain nahi kiya ki usne kya dekha tha.
    </p>

    <p>
        Lekin police file mein ek final note mila:
    </p>

    <p class="warning">
        "The window appears in every photograph taken
        from the girl's bedroom."
    </p>

    <p>
        Even when the camera was pointed somewhere else.
    </p>

    <div class="end">
        THE BLACK FILES — CASE #012<br>
        FILE STATUS: UNSOLVED
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
